@@ -0,0 +1,16 @@
+-- Recovered original Production migration SQL. Already recorded remotely.
+-- Five tables were left off when RLS was enabled on their sibling tables
+-- (explee_analytics_snapshots, explee_campaigns, explee_contacts,
+-- explee_messages, xero_oauth_tokens, etc. all already have RLS enabled
